ng\":8.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Prue and her classmate Curtis are drawn into a magical forest filled with enchanted creatures, loyal allies, and formidable adversaries as they embark on a desperate quest to rescue Prue's abducted baby brother from a murder of crows led by a mysterious woman named Alexandra.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":18239,\"title\":\"The Twilight Saga: New Moon\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k2qTooPlHffgNABNWxeJdGMglPK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dF2c20sRDgySZLaLS2OUerL07sz.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Forks, Washington resident Bella Swan is reeling from the departure of her vampire love, Edward Cullen, and finds comfort in her friendship with Jacob Black, a werewolf. But before she knows it, she's thrust into a centuries-old conflict, and her desire to be with Edward at any cost leads her to take greater and greater risks.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":116745,\"title\":\"The Secret Life of Walter Mitty\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iAo1hlzsPV9XpYcLQp6Ud065tGO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8hSjOHRY4OUEpqxszYbMdem8z9C.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A timid magazine photo manager who lives life vicariously through daydreams embarks on a true-life adventure when a negative goes missing.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":397567,\"title\":\"Along with the Gods: The Two Worlds\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gJSvIsI6oQfFim0PGyuuiCYfqKs.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wyv2Y9vXYJwJzF6cNVuVwVOsOUj.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Having died unexpectedly, firefighter Ja-hong is taken to the afterlife by 3 afterlife guardians. Only when he passes 7 trials over 49 days and proves he was innocent in human life, he’s able to reincarnate, and his 3 afterlife guardians are by his side to defend him in trial.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":587,\"title\":\"Big Fish\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tjK063yCgaBAluVU72rZ6PKPH2l.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bLqUd0tBvKezDr9MEla7k34i3rp.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Throughout his life Edward Bloom has always been a man of big appetites, enormous passions and tall tales. In his later years, he remains a huge mystery to his son, William. Now, to get to know the real man, Will begins piecing together a true picture of his father from flashbacks of his amazing adventures.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":8204,\"title\":\"The Spiderwick Chronicles\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uN7MUMaCXfa8DbMMp61A8iXEcEG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cVfaHnjOOS5qX8z10qnBsslq2Oi.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Upon moving into the run-down Spiderwick Estate with their mother, twin brothers Jared and Simon Grace, along with their sister Mallory, find themselves pulled into an alternate world full of faeries and other creatures.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":14784,\"title\":\"The Fall\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ez7xavvDr5yDz4sSvI55xDp0BoU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vNrXoT45xscHY6AN4IGf44vHxVJ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In a hospital on the outskirts of 1920s Los Angeles, an injured stuntman begins to tell a fellow patient, a little girl with a broken arm, a fantastic story about 5 mythical heroes. Thanks to his fractured state of mind and her vivid imagination, the line between fiction and reality starts to blur as the tale advances.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":58595,\"title\":\"Snow White and the Huntsman\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8HUa5kRubYbnAD5UVpnhTGGgMTW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/KBe9fHU5rVg4daoKnFwl1Cbc28.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After the Evil Queen marries the King, she performs a violent coup in which the King is murdered and his daughter, Snow White, is taken captive. Almost a decade later, a grown Snow White is still in the clutches of the Queen. In order to obtain immortality, The Evil Queen needs the heart of Snow White. After Snow escapes the castle, the Queen sends the Huntsman to find her in the Dark Forest.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":7840,\"title\":\"10,000 BC\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9I7gV6wRbGnbfI3XOKjHeLMjYEo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nZlvmbnx5ZJYkSVocuQvOgVlWli.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A prehistoric epic that follows a young mammoth hunter's journey through uncharted territory to secure the future of his tribe.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Action\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":11653,\"title\":\"The Myth\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iBDFnLkTZZxQlbb6IIeYkufnPCY.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xChyWmjDeEH8zOVi9dwVrtIJEfd.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a fellow scientist asks for Jack's help in locating the mausoleum of China's first emperor, the past collides violently with the present as Jack discovers his amazing visions are based in fact.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":559907,\"title\":\"The Green Knight\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/if4hw3Ou5Sav9Em7WWHj66mnywp.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.or